WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.933 --> 00:00:04.770
Episode six
is very, very important

00:00:04.870 --> 00:00:06.038
for our characters,

00:00:06.172 --> 00:00:08.841
quite epiphanic for Valentina.

00:00:08.941 --> 00:00:11.777
<i> What about you?
 Wasn't it epiphanic?</i>

00:00:12.211 --> 00:00:14.714
Of course. Of course,
she likes you, you know.

00:00:14.814 --> 00:00:17.917
-You just like me.
-(LAUGHTER)

00:00:18.351 --> 00:00:21.087
♪ (SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:22.154 --> 00:00:25.891 line:0%
All Mia wants is just to play
that piano.

00:00:25.991 --> 00:00:29.929
Like, she knows that maybe if
she manipulates you into that,

00:00:30.029 --> 00:00:31.230
then she'll get it.

00:00:31.597 --> 00:00:35.768 line:0%
(SPEAKING ITALIAN)

00:00:36.102 --> 00:00:39.805
You think
that you manipulate me.

00:00:39.905 --> 00:00:41.908
I don't know
if you manipulate me

00:00:42.308 --> 00:00:46.979
or if you are sincere. Valentina
doesn't feel seen by people.

00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:50.816
That's why it was heartbreaking

00:00:50.916 --> 00:00:54.487
that Isabella was with Rocco.

00:00:54.587 --> 00:00:57.824 line:0%
(SPEAKING ITALIAN)

00:01:01.427 --> 00:01:03.629
And in fact,
Valentina breaks down,

00:01:03.729 --> 00:01:08.734
-and in that moment...
-Mia comes in to finish her up.

00:01:08.834 --> 00:01:10.803
-(LAUGHTER)
-Exactly.

00:01:10.903 --> 00:01:12.839 line:0%
(SPEAKING ITALIAN)

00:01:15.741 --> 00:01:18.778
Isn't it so interesting
that this dynamic,

00:01:18.878 --> 00:01:21.981
that you give me something,
I give you something,

00:01:22.081 --> 00:01:25.985
it's known
as a male-female dynamic.

00:01:26.085 --> 00:01:29.856
And there is this dynamic
between two women.

00:01:29.956 --> 00:01:31.423 line:0%
(SPEAKING ITALIAN)

00:01:31.524 --> 00:01:32.291
(CHUCKLES)

00:01:32.925 --> 00:01:37.530
For Valentina, to live
what she lived in episode six,

00:01:37.630 --> 00:01:42.268
it's something that is going
to change her life forever.

00:01:42.368 --> 00:01:46.939
I think that probably Valentina
finally accepts the idea

00:01:47.039 --> 00:01:50.609
that a new life could be
possible for her.

00:01:50.709 --> 00:01:53.045
The funny thing
about our two characters

00:01:53.145 --> 00:01:54.948
is that we start off,
I am innocent,

00:01:55.048 --> 00:01:58.283
and she is very explosive.
And then, eventually, we switch.

00:01:58.817 --> 00:02:01.554
<i> It's interesting material.
 All of the characters</i>

00:02:01.654 --> 00:02:04.123
are really tragic in a way,
but they're really funny.

00:02:04.223 --> 00:02:06.392
It's just exciting to play
a character like this.

00:02:09.128 --> 00:02:11.364
♪ (UPBEAT MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:02:15.868 --> 00:02:18.137
Tanya. Absolutely.

00:02:18.237 --> 00:02:20.940
-I love Tanya.
-She's the best! She's the best!
But she's hard work.

00:02:21.040 --> 00:02:23.342
-Hey! Thank you.
-Okay.

00:02:23.442 --> 00:02:24.944
I think I would pick
an easy person.

00:02:25.044 --> 00:02:26.712
Maybe I'll go with Albie.

00:02:27.112 --> 00:02:29.149
He's okay with everything.
(CHUCKLES)

00:02:32.752 --> 00:02:35.822
When I'm traveling, I like
to drink when I get there.

00:02:35.922 --> 00:02:38.891
Otherwise, I just feel sick,
maybe, on the way.

00:02:39.859 --> 00:02:42.629
SABRINA IMPACCIATORE:
Maybe I could drink
during the flight.

00:02:42.729 --> 00:02:46.399
Yes, a good glass of red wine,
yes.

00:02:50.570 --> 00:02:53.372
I don't have limits
in my desire of traveling.

00:02:53.472 --> 00:02:58.678
<i> Beaches, mountains, cities,
 I would go everywhere.</i>

00:02:58.778 --> 00:03:00.446
I think I love mountains.

00:03:00.546 --> 00:03:02.916
I love everything,
but I love mountains.

00:03:06.919 --> 00:03:10.523
Oh, my god, me, when I go
on vacation, I'm totally wild.

00:03:10.623 --> 00:03:14.694
My idea of vacation
is following smells and sounds.

00:03:14.794 --> 00:03:17.596
So me, I love to arrive
in a place,

00:03:17.696 --> 00:03:20.967
and the first smell I like,
I follow the smell.

00:03:21.067 --> 00:03:25.104
I am so disorganized, so I think
I can't plan anything.

00:03:25.204 --> 00:03:28.308
So when I travel, I just go
with the flow.

